import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 399 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji-Ning Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Resource Consumption on the Cultivation Road","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 399 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji-Ning Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Resource Consumption on the Cultivation Road","no":399,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Predatory Thinking","Dual System","Zero-Sum Cultivation"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","22-Resource Allocation Joint-Contracting Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0399_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁掠夺思维拆解-修仙路上的资源消耗.md","filePath":"en/0399_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁掠夺思维拆解-修仙路上的资源消耗.md"}'),s={name:"en/0399_模块2-莽荒纪-纪宁掠夺思维拆解-修仙路上的资源消耗.md"};function a(r,e,l,u,d,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-399-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-ji-ning-predatory-thinking-decomposition-resource-consumption-on-the-cultivation-road" tabindex="-1">Entry 399 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji-Ning Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Resource Consumption on the Cultivation Road <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-399-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-ji-ning-predatory-thinking-decomposition-resource-consumption-on-the-cultivation-road" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 399 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Ji-Ning Predatory-Thinking Decomposition: Resource Consumption on the Cultivation Road&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 4) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 22</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-kind-person-can-also-stand-at-the-top-of-a-predatory-structure" tabindex="-1">Introduction: a kind person can also stand at the top of a predatory structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-kind-person-can-also-stand-at-the-top-of-a-predatory-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: a kind person can also stand at the top of a predatory structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six top-level axioms open with the anti-predation axiom — develop increment, do not consume stock, the Great Dao fully open at all tiers. This entry specializes in Ji Ning&#39;s predatory thinking. Must first explain: Ji Ning is not a villain; he values affection, keeps his word, protects his own; in the Manghuang world he already counts as a rare good person. But in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s definition, <strong>predatory thinking is judged not by malice but by structure</strong> — whether you stand at the top of this jurisprudence of &quot;strong ones seize stock, might makes right&quot; and take it as self-evident. The law-first axiom requires us to pull this jurisprudence itself into the sunlight for inspection. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The first consequence of predatory thinking is the energy waste of resource allocation. Every step of Ji Ning&#39;s road is &quot;consuming stock&quot;: devouring fierce beasts for body-refining, seizing spirit veins for qi-refining, entering secret realms to grab inheritances. This stock could have supported a generation via &quot;develop increment,&quot; but under predatory jurisprudence it is defined as &quot;ownerless, the able take&quot; — so the best grabber takes the most, yet resource utilization is pitifully low.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How predatory jurisprudence manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Stock gets scarcer the more grabbed</strong>: cave-heavens, spirit veins, heaven-earth treasures are all closed stock; under zero-sum games, one person becomes Dao means many lose Dao</li><li><strong>Latecomers have no road</strong>: predecessors grab all easy-to-mine resources; later generations can only gnaw hard bones; overall cultivation threshold rises generation by generation</li><li><strong>Strong ones define ownership</strong>: whoever is strong interprets &quot;what is ownerless&quot;; the weak do not even qualify to say &quot;this is mine&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is this entry&#39;s core, decomposing Ji Ning&#39;s predatory structure layer by layer:</p><ul><li><strong>Resource privatization narrative</strong>: every spirit treasure, every beast pill, Ji Ning&#39;s first reaction is &quot;can I refine it,&quot; not &quot;whose was this originally, is it public or not.&quot; Seizing treasure is in narrative beautified as &quot;adventure&quot;</li><li><strong>Dual-system double predation</strong>: others grab one share, Ji Ning grabs two — body-refining needs fierce beasts, qi-refining needs spirit qi; his predation coverage naturally doubles</li><li><strong>Causation not settled</strong>: the transmigrator arrives with past-life advantage; what he plunders is not only the Manghuang world&#39;s material stock, but also the &quot;time-difference dividend,&quot; yet never settles this cross-plane account</li><li><strong>The &quot;righteous rogue&quot; absent</strong>: Ji Ning never reaches that step — tearing up the old jurisprudence of &quot;the able take&quot; and rewriting resource-allocation rules as Myriad-Ranks public. He is an orderly strong one, not a revolutionary rogue</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Ji Ning&#39;s Predatory Structure</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative Structure</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ownerless things, the able take</td><td>Develop incremental Origin, do not consume stock, anti-predation constitutionally written</td></tr><tr><td>Dual system one person eats two shares</td><td>Body and qi dual paths open; resources jointly contracted, more work more pay</td></tr><tr><td>Secret realms first-come-first-served</td><td>Cultivation-resource opening mechanism; 300 Origin systems shared free</td></tr><tr><td>Transmigrator arbitrage not settled</td><td>Causal self-discipline: cross-plane return only knowledge, disturbance must be supervised</td></tr><tr><td>Strong ones define resource ownership</td><td>Anchor Council legislates; resource ownership no longer decided by fists</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s &quot;stock resource pool&quot; and Ji-Ning-road cumulative consumption curve</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;predatory mining,&quot; &quot;increment development,&quot; &quot;Anchor-Symbiosis allocation&quot; three resource institutions</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: resource pool half-life, latecomer success rate, weak survival probability</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under predatory mining the resource pool has the shortest half-life, latecomer success rate declines generation by generation; under a symbiotic scheme all three dominate comprehensively</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;Ownerless&quot; boundaries move with plot; early rare materials later casually obtainable</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium-high</strong>. Total resource volume continuously watered to serve protagonist leveling; early scarcity constraints become nominal late</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. If predatory jurisprudence had no Ji-Ning-this-&quot;strongest-predator&quot; maintaining order, it might collapse even faster</li></ul><p>Add another layer: predatory thinking in Manghuang is even packaged as the protagonist&#39;s virtue. When Ji Ning grabs treasures, narrative emphasizes he protects his own, keeps his word, does not indiscriminately kill; thus predation becomes righteous predation. Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny his personal conduct, but precisely therefore it is more dangerous — a predator with no moral flaw makes readers mistakenly think this jurisprudence itself has no problem. What truly needs changing is not Ji Ning&#39;s character, but the rules that force him to grab; as long as the rules remain, swap in a good person, and Myriad Ranks are still eaten clean.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: predatory mining utilization low; large stock lost in fighting</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: &quot;the able take&quot; zero-sum narrative is Ji-Ning-road&#39;s bottom jurisprudence</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least broke aristocratic monopoly; Ji Ning never challenged the jurisprudence itself of &quot;strong ones seize resources&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: predation&#39;s endpoint is Myriad Ranks supporting one clan one person; demon races, mortals are all stock</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a closed stock pool cannot support infinite expansion; predatory jurisprudence is fundamentally opposed to hyper-multiverse full openness</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ji Ning&#39;s kindness is real, but kindness cannot stop structure. A good person standing at the top of the predatory pyramid only makes this pyramid look less evil — yet its efficiency at squeezing Myriad Ranks has not dropped one bit. What Heng Yuan Zhou must ask is not &quot;is Ji Ning bad,&quot; but &quot;should this jurisprudence that forces even good people to grab be swapped out wholesale.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Ji-Ning predatory-thinking decomposition · resource consumption on the cultivation road described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./398_模块2-莽荒纪-历史倒退必然性-大能陨落文明即断代.html">Entry 398 · Inevitable Historical Regression</a> · <a href="./400_模块2-莽荒纪-炼气体系批判-掠夺天地灵气的零和博弈.html">Entry 400 · Qi-Refining-System Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
